From {{inh|en|enm|schadowe}}, {{m|enm|schadewe}}, {{m|enm|schadwe}} (also {{m|enm|schade}} > {{l|en|shade}}), from {{inh|en|ang|sċeaduwe}}, {{m|ang|sċeadwe}}, oblique form of {{m|ang|sċeadu|t=shadow, shade; darkness; protection}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*skadu}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*skaduz||shade, shadow}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*(s)ḱeh₃-||darkness}}. {{dbt|en|shade}}.

{{col-top|2|cog}}
Cognate with {{cog|sco|shedda|t=shadow}}, {{cog|stq|Skaad}}, {{m|stq|Skade|t=shade, shadow}}, {{cog|fy|skaad}}, {{m|fy|skâd|t=shade, shadow}}, {{cog|gmw-cfr,li|Schatte|t=shadow}}, {{cog|nl|schade}}, {{m|nl|schaduw|t=shadow}}, {{cog|de|Schatten|t=shade, shadow}}, {{cog|nds-de|Scharr}}, {{m|nds-de|Scharre|t=shade, shadow}}, {{cog|lb|Schiet|t=shade, shadow}}, {{cog|wym|siota|t=shadow}}, {{cog|yi|שאָטן|t=shadow}}, {{cog|fo|skadda|t=thick wet mountain fog}}, {{cog|is|skodda}}, {{m|is|skoddi|t=shadow}}, {{cog|nb|skodde|t=fog, mist}}, {{cog|nn|skodde}}, {{m|nn|skåddj}}, {{m|nn|skåidd|t=fog; ice fog}}, {{cog|got|𐍃𐌺𐌰𐌳𐌿𐍃|t=shadow}}; also {{cog|br|skeud|t=shadow; reflection; ghost}}, {{cog|kw|skeus|t=shadow; reflection}}, {{cog|ga|scáth|t=shadow}}, {{cog|gv|scaa}}, {{m|gv|skæ|t=shield; shade, shadow}}, {{cog|gd|sgàth|t=shade, shadow}}, {{cog|la|obscurus|t=dark, dusky, shadowy}}, {{cog|grc|σκότος|t=darkness, gloom}} (whence {{cog|en|scoto-}}), {{cog|be|сівы́|t=grey}}, {{cog|cs,sk|sivý|t=grey}}, {{cog|mk|осој|t=shady place}}, {{cog|pl|siwy|t=grey}}, {{cog|ru|си́вый|t=grey}}, {{cog|sh|сив}}, {{m|sh|siv|t=grey}}, {{cog|sl|osoja|t=shady place}}, {{cog|uk|си́вий|t=grey}}, {{cog|hy|սեաւ}}, {{m|hy|սեւ|t=black}}, {{cog|os|сау|t=black}}, {{cog|fa|سه|tr=sah}}, {{m|fa|سیه|tr=siyah}}, {{m|fa|سیاه|tr=siyâh|t=black}}, {{cog|sa|श्याम|t=black}}, {{m|sa|श्याव|t=dark}}. 
