#: {{ux|en|I've painted my room in five lovely '''shades''' of pink and chartreuse.}}
#* {{RQ:Locke Human Understanding|text=Thus light and colours, as white, red, yellow, blue, with their several degrees or '''shades''', and mixtures, as green, scarlet, purple, sea-green, and the rest, come in only by the eyes{{...}}}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Lauren Caruso and Jillian Tracy|title=The 22 best sunglasses for summer, according to style experts|magazine=w:CNN|url=https://www.cnn.com/cnn-underscored/fashion/best-sunglasses-2023|date=2023-06-26|passage=Speaking of round sunglasses, these lightweight polarized ones and come in two '''shades''' of tortoiseshell as well as black and bronze.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20250414045427/https://www.cnn.com/cnn-underscored/fashion/best-sunglasses-2023|archivedate=14 April 2025}}
