|passage=Mrs. Rhodes who (so I gathered from Mr. Petherick's careful language) was perhaps just a '''shade''' of a hypochondriac, had retired to bed immediately after dinner.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=07 Apr 90|journal=Gay Community News|page=12|author=Wickie Stamps|title=The 'Temple' Is Familiar|text=Five feet in diameter and a '''shade''' above knee high, the center of the fragile white canvass structure is filled with {{...}}}}
